  2. What averaging gains, against what the binormal model predicts from the members alone.
     n_eff = n / (1 + (n - 1) * mean within-label correlation): the number of independent
     reviewers the members are worth. Prediction: AUC of the mean of the members' d' times
     sqrt(n_eff); 'if independent' sets n_eff = n.

